# Documentation Sync

- Treat `docs/concepts/` as the active documentation surface.
- Keep `docs/specs/` aligned when semantics/contracts change.
- Treat `docs/archive/` as historical context, not active planning.
- When implementation changes system behavior, update the corresponding concept doc and spec (if needed) in the same turn.
- Do not declare docs sync complete if active docs still reference obsolete structure paths.
- Preserve concise, scanable naming and avoid over-structuring.
